228
00:21:14,607 --> 00:21:17,485
Beware the stare of Mary Shaw .

229
00:21:17,485 --> 00:21:20,488
She had no children , only dolls ,

230
00:21:20,488 --> 00:21:22,448
and if you see her in your dreams

231
