259
00:22:18,088 --> 00:22:20,090
And his second wife ,

260
00:22:20,090 --> 00:22:21,340
and that one there ...

261
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:23,301
but she was smart enough to leave .

262
00:22:23,301 --> 00:22:25,428
So it 's a good thing you 're gonna outlive him , lady .

263
00:22:25,428 --> 00:22:27,264
There 'll be no one to paint you out .

264
00:22:38,441 --> 00:22:40,443
[ rings doorbell ] WOMAN : What more

265
